---
/**
 * Feature 3 - Live evals watch traffic. A cohort freezes it.
 *
 * Logfire's loop is continuous and Kitaru's population is pinned, so the left
 * column is a moving stream and the right is a fixed grid. Both are honest
 * strengths; the contrast is time, not quality.
 */
---

<figure class="fig">
  <div class="side side--competitor">
    <div class="side-head">
      <span class="side-label">Logfire &middot; live evals</span>
      <span class="side-sub">Scored as the traffic arrives</span>
    </div>

    <div class="stream">
      <div class="tick">
        <span class="tick-time mono">09:41:02</span>
        <span class="tick-val">span scored &middot; pass</span>
      </div>
      <div class="tick">
        <span class="tick-time mono">09:41:07</span>
        <span class="tick-val">span scored &middot; pass</span>
      </div>
      <div class="tick tick--fail">
        <span class="tick-time mono">09:41:11</span>
        <span class="tick-val">span scored &middot; fail</span>
      </div>
      <div class="tick tick--next" aria-hidden="true">
        <span class="tick-time mono">09:41:1</span>
        <span class="tick-val">&hellip;</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="chain">
      <span class="chain-step mono">WHERE score &lt; 0.5</span>
      <span class="chain-arrow" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
      <span class="chain-step">alert to Slack</span>
    </div>

    <div class="note">
      The regression shows up in the same trace that produced it. The window
      keeps moving, so what you looked at yesterday is not what you query today.
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="side side--kitaru">
    <div class="side-head">
      <span class="side-label side-label--accent">Kitaru &middot; cohort version</span>
      <span class="side-sub">Pinned, replayed on every change</span>
    </div>

    <div class="grid">
      <span class="case case--real mono">#4821</span>
      <span class="case case--real mono">#4822</span>
      <span class="case case--real mono">#4830</span>
      <span class="case case--real mono">#4844</span>
      <span class="case case--real mono">#4851</span>
      <span class="case case--flag mono">#4862 &#9873;</span>
    </div>

    <div class="chain chain--accent">
      <span class="chain-step chain-step--accent mono">week-32</span>
      <span class="chain-arrow chain-arrow--accent" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
      <span class="chain-step chain-step--accent">replayed on every change</span>
    </div>

    <div class="note">
      The member list never changes after creation, so a result keeps meaning
      what it meant. The flagged one is the run a live eval failed on Tuesday.
    </div>
  </div>
</figure>

<style>
  .fig {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 16px;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .side {
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 16px 16px 14px;
    background: var(--color-surface);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }
  .side--competitor { background: var(--color-surface-warm); }
  .side--kitaru { border-color: var(--color-accent); }

  .side-head { margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .side-label {
    display: block;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .side-label--accent { color: var(--color-accent); }
  .side-sub {
    display: block;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--color-secondary);
  }

  .stream {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 5px;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }
  .tick {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 9px;
    padding: 6px 10px;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border-light);
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: var(--color-bg);
  }
  .tick--fail {
    border-color: var(--color-cost-up);
    background: var(--color-cost-up-bg);
  }
  .tick--next {
    border-style: dashed;
    opacity: 0.45;
  }
  .tick-time {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 9.5px;
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }
  .tick-val {
    font-size: 10.5px;
    color: var(--color-secondary);
  }
  .tick--fail .tick-val { color: var(--color-cost-up); font-weight: 700; }

  .grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 6px;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }
  .case {
    padding: 6px 4px;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border-light);
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: var(--color-bg);
    font-size: 10px;
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--color-secondary);
  }
  .case--real { border-color: var(--color-border-accent); color: var(--color-primary); }
  .case--flag {
    border-color: var(--color-accent);
    background: var(--color-accent-light);
    color: var(--color-accent-deep);
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .mono { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 9.5px; }

  .chain {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 7px;
    padding: 8px 10px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: var(--color-surface-subtle);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border-light);
  }
  .chain--accent {
    background: var(--color-accent-light);
    border-color: var(--color-border-accent);
  }
  .chain-step {
    font-size: 10.5px;
    color: var(--color-primary);
  }
  .chain-step--accent { color: var(--color-accent-deep); }
  .chain-arrow { font-size: 12px; color: var(--color-muted); }
  .chain-arrow--accent { color: var(--color-accent); }

  .note {
    margin-top: 12px;
    padding-top: 10px;
    border-top: 1px dashed var(--color-border-light);
    font-size: 10.5px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .fig { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
